OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAnother dry, fine and warm day
OL,6,Ffor much of the country. However,
OL,7,Fthicker cloud will move into northern
OL,8,Fparts later in the day, with some
OL,9,Fpatchy rain arriving after dark.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,12,Flittle more cloud in the sky on
OL,13,FMonday, before the sunny weather
OL,14,Freturns on Tuesday and Wednesday.
OL,15,FTemperatures briefly dip on Monday
OL,16,Fbefore becoming very warm again by
OL,17,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
